    {
      "id": "the-second-part-of-king-henry-the-sixth/sceneV_13.3/p@200899",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "YORK.\nI know our safety is to follow them;\nFor, as I hear, the King is fled to London\nTo call a present court of parliament.\nLet us pursue him ere the writs go forth.\nWhat says Lord Warwick? Shall we after them?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
